  "description": "Avel is a cute young girl who’s chaotic and a little violent. She couldn’t care less about social rules and polite society. Nevertheless, to avoid her tragic fate in the future of this novel at the hands of the cold first prince Chesa, she has to get to him while he’s young and teach him to be a good person. So what if she has to break some rules (and kick some butts) along the way? What matters is that the neglected boy learns to care for other people. What could possibly go wrong?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
